  "details": "The current default for new expression menu controls is \"button\", yet this isn't used all that commonly. Making the much more commonly used \"toggle\" control type the default would greatly help in reducing time setting up menus, as well as accidental cases of leaving them as buttons (which unlike leaving a button a toggle has no easy workaround other than using OSC, when updating your avatar is currently impractical)",
